        "bodyHtml": "Akshan throws a boomerang that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(45/75/105/135/165 + (70% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>, extending the range each time an enemy is hit.<br /><br />Champion hits grant Akshan <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(20% + (5% per 100 Ability Power)) Move Speed</span> decaying over 1 second.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 40/50/60/70/80% damage to non-champions. Enemies hit are briefly revealed.</span>",
